#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:11 6d69384348984488a20584daec0cea20
msgid ""
"Sensor Redundancy: ArduPilot supports redundant IMUS, GPS, etc. Many "
"controllers have multiple IMUs integrated on board for applications "
"requiring this level of reliability."
msgstr "传感器冗余：ArduPilot 支持冗余 IMU、GPS 等。许多飞控板集成了多个 IMU，适用于对可靠性要求较高的应用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:12 a71680b4a13b4173bb8147149b0073f3
msgid "Number of Servo/Motor Outputs."
msgstr "舵机/电机输出数量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:13 d23004531f4944af8b0e7f6eb26bffad
msgid ""
"Number of UARTs: Telemetry radios, GPS's, Companion Computers, etc can be"
" attached via these ports."
msgstr "UART 数量：数传电台、GPS、伴侣计算机等均可通过这些端口连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:14 9e40d267bed24871a7e1bbd76421008c
msgid ""
"External Buses: I2C, CAN, etc. allow many types of devices, such as "
"airspeed sensors, LED controllers, etc. to be attached to the autopilot."
msgstr "外部总线：I2C、CAN 等可连接多种设备，如空速传感器、LED 控制器等。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:15 53b60438c093492f82872e54457fd935
msgid ""
"Number of Analog I/O: Some controllers have analog I/O available for such"
" features as inputting receiver signal strength (RSSI) or battery "
"voltage/current or other analog sensors."
msgstr "模拟 I/O 数量：部分飞控提供模拟 I/O，用于接收机信号强度（RSSI）、电池电压/电流或其他模拟传感器输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:16 fe57c9b027d44b70af2ad5e276666080
msgid ""
"Integrated Features: Such as on-board OSD (On Screen Display), integrated"
" battery monitoring sensors."
msgstr "集成功能：如板载 OSD（屏幕显示）、集成电池监测传感器等。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:17 17e7177db8b84ba6be0c2b2874c5b47f
msgid ""
"Vibration Isolation: Internal mechanical vibration isolators for IMUs for"
" high vibration applications."
msgstr "减震隔离：为 IMU 提供内置机械减震，适用于高震动应用场景。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:18 a9afe89530be4f79afe043db249fb52e
msgid ""
"IMU Heaters: On board temperature control of IMUs for applications in "
"harsh environments or widely varying temperatures during a flight to "
"provide the highest possible precision."
msgstr "IMU 加热器：板载 IMU 温控，适用于恶劣环境或飞行中温度变化较大的场景，以提供尽可能高的精度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:19 e019877077f94cfd835378928bc30a9a
msgid "Size: Many vehicles have limited space for the autopilot."
msgstr "尺寸：许多机体对飞控安装空间有限制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:20 da3cf0537abd478bb02dda1e95cda883
msgid ""
"Expense: Controller prices range from ~$25 to much more, depending on "
"feature set."
msgstr "价格：飞控价格从约 25 美元到更高不等，取决于功能配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:22 ba7711c5c85941db92cd0fd72ddaf2bf
msgid ""
"The sections below provide information about ArduPilot autopilot hardware"
" options.  The list below is sorted by manufacturer and product name."
msgstr "以下各节提供 ArduPilot 飞控硬件选项的相关信息。下列清单按制造商和产品名称排序。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:26 072bbdfc8cd149f68730aaa97c5c8fbb
msgid ""
"There are also numerous clones and minor variants of the boards linked "
"below. Many of these may be perfectly capable replacements. Help in "
"selecting an autopilot can also be obtained in the user forums "
"(`ArduPilot Discuss <https://discuss.ardupilot.org>`__ or `RC Groups "
"<https://www.rcgroups.com/forums/showthread.php?3102183-Most-Integrated-"
"Ardupilot-Flight-Controller-%28ChiBios%29>`__ )."
msgstr ""
"以下链接中的飞控板还存在众多克隆版和小幅改型版，其中许多可作为完全可用的替代品。选择飞控时也可在用户论坛（`ArduPilot Discuss "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org>`__ 或 `RC Groups "
"<https://www.rcgroups.com/forums/showthread.php?3102183-Most-Integrated-"
"Ardupilot-Flight-Controller-%28ChiBios%29>`__）中获取帮助。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:31 36293157851d4f76a2ab7bdbaace2eda
msgid ""
"Not all of these autopilots have been directly tested by ArduPilot "
"development team members and while firmware  is provided by ArduPilot, it"
" does not constitute an endorsement by ArduPilot.  However, most boards "
"developed by ArduPilot Partners have been provided to the ArduPilot "
"development team to aid in any possible support issues that might arise."
msgstr ""
"并非所有这些飞控均经过 ArduPilot 开发团队成员的直接测试，虽然 ArduPilot 提供固件支持，但这并不代表 ArduPilot "
"对其进行背书。不过，大多数由 ArduPilot 合作伙伴开发的飞控板已提供给 ArduPilot 开发团队，以协助处理可能出现的支持问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:35 ad4d3c00f3bb4686b11a8ab7127b6840
msgid "Open Hardware"
msgstr "开源硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:70 cfdb28b75cd94acca61e4be240d2b969
msgid ""
"\\* due to flash memory limitations, these boards do not include all "
"ArduPilot features. See :ref:`Firmware Limitations <common-"
"limited_firmware>` for details."
msgstr ""
"\\* 由于闪存容量限制，这些板不包含 ArduPilot 的全部功能。详情请参见 :ref:`固件限制 <common-"
"limited_firmware>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:73 c3750a598310440b81b0d42f3e711b27
msgid "Closed Hardware"
msgstr "闭源硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:209 c3e87ffb05f84df5930ac87fac7338e8
msgid ""
"due to flash memory limitations, most F4 based, and some other boards, do"
" not include all ArduPilot features. See :ref:`Firmware Limitations "
"<common-limited_firmware>` for details."
msgstr ""
"由于闪存容量限制，大多数基于 F4 的板以及部分其他板不包含 ArduPilot 的全部功能。详情请参见 :ref:`固件限制 <common-"
"limited_firmware>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:212 1463afecfaac45bea64c412429519fba
msgid "Linux Based Autopilots"
msgstr "基于 Linux 的飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:214 f4c43a74d14a4c9996544b7c54876b20
msgid ""
"These autopilots use an underlying Linux OS. Linux boards usually have "
"more CPU power and memory many of the other boards listed on this page, "
"but do not support DShot, Bi-Directional DShot, BLHeli ESC passthrough, "
"many of the ArduPilot GPIO based features, and easy upload from the "
"ground stations. They do allow experimentation and development of "
"advanced control and navigation algorithms (see also :ref:`common-"
"companion-computers`)."
msgstr ""
"这些飞控使用底层 Linux 操作系统。Linux 板通常比本页列出的其他飞控板拥有更强的 CPU 算力和更大的内存，但不支持 DShot、双向 "
"DShot、BLHeli ESC 直通、许多 ArduPilot GPIO "
"相关功能以及从地面站直接上传固件。它们允许对高级控制和导航算法进行实验和开发（另见 :ref:`common-companion-"
"computers`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:225 ff28ec7d8f434b8bb078939ba7ae1d91
msgid ""
"\\** these devices are sensor add-on boards for a Linux-based "
"microcomputer. See board links for details."
msgstr "\\** 这些设备是适用于基于 Linux 的微型计算机的传感器扩展板。详情请参见各板链接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:227 5ead058399c94096990586df0bb142c0
msgid ""
"For more information on using ArduPilot on Linux based boards, see :ref"
":`building-the-code`"
msgstr "有关在基于 Linux 的飞控上使用 ArduPilot 的更多信息，请参见 :ref:`building-the-code`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:232 76ae3375249b42329707dae059b80d9c
msgid ""
"Some boards have features removed in order to fit the firmware into their"
" memory capacity. See the section below:"
msgstr "部分飞控为了将固件装入其存储容量而删除了某些功能。请参阅以下章节："

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:239 dfa56a5b4e4c42bab9173c096842de6f
msgid ""
"If a board has a missing feature that is required by the user, building a"
" custom firmware using the `ArduPilot Custom Firmware Build Server "
"<https://custom.ardupilot.org>`__ can be used to create firmware which "
"drops features not needed and adding desired features back into the "
"firmware in that freed space."
msgstr ""
"若某板缺少用户所需的功能，可使用 `ArduPilot 自定义固件编译服务器 <https://custom.ardupilot.org>`__ "
"创建自定义固件，删除不需要的功能并在释放的空间中添加所需功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:242 4a4c13eb276d42b8978c9bfa99fda654
msgid "Discontinued Boards"
msgstr "已停产飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:243 f14beb1d37ef4d9792caae5f25a6e09a
msgid ""
"The following boards are no longer produced, however, documentation is "
"still available in the wiki or online, and recent builds are still "
"expected to work.  These boards are not recommended for new projects."
msgstr "以下飞控已停止生产，但 Wiki 或网络上仍有相关文档，近期版本固件预计仍可正常工作。不推荐将这些飞控用于新项目。"

