msgid ""
"The following boards are no longer supported. The documentation is "
":ref:`archived<common-archived-topics>`, but available if you're still "
"working on those platforms:"
msgstr "以下飞控已不再受支持。相关文档已 :ref:`归档<common-archived-topics>`，但如果您仍在使用这些平台，文档依然可查："

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:264 f6bfbe7072574f998ea84686edda399b
msgid ""
"APM 2.x (APM 2.6 and later) are no longer supported for Copter, Plane or "
"Rover. The last firmware builds that fit on this board are Copter 3.2.1, "
"and Plane 3.4.0, and Rover 2.5.1."
msgstr ""
"APM 2.x（APM 2.6 及更新版本）已不再支持 Copter、Plane 或 Rover。可适配本板的最后固件版本为 Copter "
"3.2.1、Plane 3.4.0 和 Rover 2.5.1。"

